---
import PrivateAppLayout from '../../layouts/PrivateAppLayout.astro';
import PrivateCopyGate from '../../components/PrivateCopyGate.astro';
const features=['Master accounts','Copier accounts','Copy relationships','Risk and allocation controls','Execution records','Provider billing','Admin monitoring','Audit trail'];
---
<PrivateAppLayout title="Trade Avata — Copy Trading">
<PrivateCopyGate />
<main class="copy-app"><header><a href="/" class="brand">TRADE <b>AVATA</b></a><nav><a class="active" href="/copy-trading/">Overview</a><a href="/copy-trading/master/">Master</a><a href="/copy-trading/copier/">Copier</a><a href="/copy-trading/activity/">Activity</a></nav></header>
<section class="hero"><div><span class="eyebrow">PRIVATE TESTING</span><h1>Copy Trading</h1><p>The production architecture is being built now. Public discovery and live execution remain separately controlled from the backend.</p><div class="actions"><a class="btn primary" href="/copy-trading/master/">Master workspace</a><a class="btn" href="/copy-trading/copier/">Copier workspace</a></div></div><div class="status"><small>MODULE STATE</small><strong id="moduleState">PRIVATE</strong><span>Visibility, registration and live execution are separate controls.</span></div></section>
<section class="grid">{features.map((f,i)=><article><small>0{i+1}</small><h2>{f}</h2><p>Included in the Copy Trading foundation and designed for backend-controlled activation.</p></article>)}</section>
<section class="flow"><span class="eyebrow">ARCHITECTURE</span><h2>Account → Strategy → Copy Relationship → Execution → Record</h2><p>The future execution engine plugs into this boundary without rebuilding the member or admin platform.</p></section>
</main>
</PrivateAppLayout>
<style is:global>
.copy-app{max-width:1220px;margin:auto;padding:24px 28px 100px}.copy-app header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:10px 0 30px}.brand{font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.08em}.brand b{color:var(--app-accent-2)}nav{display:flex;gap:18px;color:var(--app-muted);font-size:14px}nav .active{color:var(--app-text)}.hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.5fr .7fr;gap:18px;align-items:stretch;padding:80px 0}.eyebrow{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.16em;color:var(--app-accent-2);font-weight:800}.hero h1{font-size:clamp(50px,7vw,86px);letter-spacing:-.05em;margin:16px 0}.hero p{max-width:700px;color:var(--app-muted);font-size:19px;line-height:1.65}.actions{display:flex;gap:10px;margin-top:28px}.btn{display:inline-block;padding:12px 16px;border:1px solid var(--app-border);border-radius:11px;background:var(--app-panel2)}.btn.primary{background:var(--app-accent);color:#fff;border-color:transparent}.status,.grid article,.flow{border:1px solid var(--app-border);border-radius:18px;background:var(--app-panel);padding:24px}.status{display:grid;align-content:center;gap:10px}.status small,.grid small{color:var(--app-muted)}.status strong{font-size:34px;color:var(--app-accent-2)}.status span,.grid p,.flow p{color:var(--app-muted);line-height:1.6}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:12px}.grid h2{font-size:17px}.flow{margin-top:18px;padding:34px}.flow h2{font-size:30px;max-width:800px}@media(max-width:800px){.copy-app header{align-items:flex-start}.copy-app nav{overflow:auto}.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding:50px 0}.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}}@media(max-width:520px){.copy-app{padding:18px 16px 80px}.copy-app header{display:block}.copy-app nav{margin-top:14px}.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.actions{flex-direction:column}}
</style>
